Hints Framework
===============

The hints framework (aka plan hints) allows the user to override the optimizer
(ORCA) in order to coerce a plan shape by disregarding its estimated cost
compared to alternative plans.


Grammar
-------
Language specification and parser leverages pg_hint_plan module.


Supported Hints
---------------
SeqScan, NoSeqScan, IndexScan, NoIndexScan, IndexOnlyScan, NoIndexOnlyScan,
BitmapScan, and NoBitmapScan.


Unsupported Hints
-----------------
TidScan, NoTidScan, NestLoop, NoNestLoop, HashJoin, NoHashJoin, MergeJoin,
NoMergeJoin, Leading, Rows, Parallel
